# FVWM Key Bindings
# Generated from LXDE configuration

# Syntax: Key <keyname> <context> <modifier> <action>
# Context: R=Root, W=Window, T=Title, I=Icon, A=All
# Modifier: N=None, C=Ctrl, S=Shift, M=Meta/Alt, 4=Super

Key Left A CM GotoDesk -1 0
Key Right A CM GotoDesk 1 0
Key Up A CM GotoDesk 0 -1
Key Down A CM GotoDesk 0 1
Key Left A MS MoveToDesk -1 0
Key Right A MS MoveToDesk 1 0
Key Up A MS MoveToDesk 0 -1
Key Down A MS MoveToDesk 0 1
Key F1 A 4 GotoDesk 0 0
Key F2 A 4 GotoDesk 0 1
Key F3 A 4 GotoDesk 0 2
Key F4 A 4 GotoDesk 0 3
Key d A 4 ToggleShowDesktop
Key d A CM ToggleShowDesktop
Key F4 A M Close
Key Escape A M Lower
Key space A M Menu
Key Tab A M Next (CurrentDesk, !Iconic) Focus
Key Tab A MS Prev (CurrentDesk, !Iconic) Focus
Key Tab A CM Next (CurrentDesk, !Iconic) Focus
Key e A 4 Exec exec pcmanfm
Key f A 4 Exec exec pcmanfm --find-files
Key r A 4 Exec exec lxpanelctl run
Key F2 A M Exec exec lxpanelctl run
Key Escape A C Exec exec lxpanelctl menu
Key F1 A M Exec exec lxpanelctl menu
Key F11 A M Fullscreen
Key Delete A CM Exec exec lxtask
Key Print A N Exec exec gnome-screenshot -i
Key XF86Display A N Exec exec lxrandr
